      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n**FOR SALE BY ONLINE AUCTION 19TH OCTOBER @ 1PM AUCTION RESERVE 290,000*\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this fantastic two-bedroom mid terrace property superbly located in the heart of North Strand in Dublin 3.\nThis superb property boasts a prime location just off North Strand Road, offering easy access to Dublin City Centre, the IFSC, and East Point Business Park.  North Strand, East Wall, Fairview and Clontarf are just a short stroll away, providing a fantastic selection of shops, supermarkets, restaurants, cafes, and bars. The 3Arena, Croke Park, Fairview Park, and Westwood Gym are all nearby, while essential healthcare facilities, including Temple Street, The Rotunda, and The Mater Hospitals, are just minutes away by car. Excellent transport links make commuting effortless, with multiple bus routes serving North Strand Road and Connolly Train, DART and Luas Station only a 10-minute walk away. The Royal Canal Greenway is an added bonus to the area making surrounding areas quickly accessible on foot or bicycle. Additionally, the M1 and M50 motorways and Dublin Airport are easily accessible, ensuring superb connectivity.\nBright and airy internal living accommodation of c. 62 sqm comprises of an entrance hallway, living room to front with feature fireplace, fully fitted kitchen, utility room, 2 bedrooms and a main fully tiled bathroom.  The property comes to the market in good condition throughout and benefits a red brick façade, gas fired central heating, on street parking and a private patio to the rear.\nAn opportunity not to be missed: call Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 086 0469458 or 01 6995050 today for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\nAdditional Features:\n\n**FOR SALE BY ONLINE AUCTION 19TH OCTOBER @ 1PM AUCTION RESERVE 290,000*\n<ul>\n <li>c. 62 sq.m</li>\n <li>BER: G</li>\n <li>Mid Terrace</li>\n <li>Red brick facade</li>\n <li>Light filled interior</li>\n <li>Quiet cul de sac location</li>\n <li>On street parking</li>\n <li>Gas fired central heating</li>\n <li>Highly sought-after location</li>\n <li>Excellent transport links</li>\n <li>Fantastic location</li>\n <li>Close to local amenities</li>\n <li>Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike</li>\n <li>Early Viewing is highly advised</li>\n</ul>"
      },
